\par\par \b \uc2 Japan Tanigaki: Not Aiming To Weaken Yen Via  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Action  \b0\par\par\uc2 206 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 09:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Nikkei/Dow Jones)--Japanese Finance Minister Sadakazu Tanigaki defended Tokyo's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy Tuesday, saying its yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  wasn't aimed at weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 But Tanigaki, speaking in a parliamentary committee, added that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against speculators intent on driving the yen higher. [ 16-03-04 0824GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  ordered more than Y10 trillion in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first two months of this year - an amount already half the record \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  total for all of 2003.  \par \par \uc2 Japanese officials say their goal is simply to smooth excessively sharp market movements, rather than to deliberately weaken the yen.  \par \par \uc2 "We are certainly not trying to guide the yen higher or lower," Tanigaki told a Lower House finance committee. "We carry out \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when there are speculative movements or overshooting."  \par \par \uc2 But that argument has sounded increasingly hollow in recent weeks, as the dollar has rebounded from three-and-a-half-year lows just above Y105 in mid-February to more than Y112 earlier this month, with Tokyo apparently selling yen all the way through the rebound.  \par \par \uc2 At 0845 GMT, the dollar was changing hands at Y109.60. [ 16-03-04 0852GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040316e03g000a1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
