\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2 -Dlr slides vs yen as markets mull Japan policy.  \b0\par\par\uc2 By Gertrude Chavez  \par \uc2 544 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 16:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (Updates prices, adds comment, changes byline, dateline; previous LONDON)  \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK, March 16 (Reuters) - The dollar retreated against the yen on Tuesday as the market mulled the possibility that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may stop \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , following a report saying Tokyo could halt selling yen for dollars by the end of March.  \par \par \uc2 A 4 percent decline in U.S. housing starts in February had little impact as investors focused on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy article in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's influential Nikkei Financial Daily and on the U.S. Federal Reserve policy meeting due later in the day.  \par \par \uc2 Japanese officials denied any change in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, though a comment by Bank of Japan Governor Toshihiko Fukui that irregular \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves had abated was interpreted by some as indicating a more relaxed stance on the yen's strength.  \par \par \uc2 By midmorning in New York, the dollar had fallen 0.9 percent to 109.23 yen . Some dealers suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Tokyo trade but the effect was short-lived.  \par \par \uc2 "Regardless of whether the MoF (\b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) denied the BoJ (Bank of Japan) commentary, the market believes they have sent a signal, that this reflects the way Japanese officials are beginning to think about the issue," said Marc Chandler, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at HSBC in New York.  \par \par \uc2 "The conventional wisdom right now is that the dollar/yen is going back to 105," he added.  \par \par \uc2 The euro was up around 0.6 percent against the dollar at $1.2341 .  \par \par \uc2 The dollar was off about 0.3 percent at 1.2699 Swiss francs . Sterling traded up 0.7 percent at $1.8173 .  \par \par \uc2 "(The housing data) was a little bit soft. But we do have a number of elements that are still playing positively for the housing market," said Andrew Delano, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at IDEAglobal in New York.  \par \par \uc2 Housing starts fell to an adjusted annual rate of 1.855 million, well below the 1.930 million pace analysts expected.  \par \par \uc2 "As far as the dollar is concerned, it doesn't look like it's having too devastating of an impact," Delano added.  \par \par \uc2 FOCUS ON FOMC, DISMAL ZEW  \par \par \uc2 Tuesday's Federal Reserve meeting remains in focus and expectations are for U.S. interest rates to stay at 1 percent, but the accompanying outlook statement should be crucial to the dollar's direction, analysts say.  \par \par \uc2 "We expect no fundamental change in the statement, but we may see the Fed reemphasize that current low U.S. interest rates are not sustainable. This should be dollar-supportive," said Chandler.  \par \par \uc2 The euro gain from the dollar's weakness, shrugging off an unexpectedly sharp fall in German investor expectations.  \par \par \uc2 Germany's ZEW institute said its gauge of economic expectations fell in March, for the third straight month, to its lowest level since last summer. It blamed the fall on concerns over the pace of Europe's economic recovery, particularly after last week's deadly bombings in Madrid.  \par \par \uc2 Earlier on Tuesday the Bank of Japan kept its monetary policy unchanged, taking heart from mounting evidence of an economic pickup. It kept its economic assessment unchanged in a monthly report, saying the economy was in a gradual recovery. (Additional reporting by Kyle Peterson in Chicago and Christina Fincher in London).   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040316e03g0023i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
