\par\par \b \uc2 Japan Tanigaki: To Act As Needed Vs Speculative  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Moves  \b0\par\par\uc2 240 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 00:58\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's finance minister said Tuesday there has been no change to Tokyo's policy of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to curb speculative movements.  \par \par \uc2 "I won't comment on daily \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  levels, but our stance remains unchanged," Sadakazu Tanigaki told reporters. "We believe \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates should move stably in reflection of (economic) fundamentals." [ 16-03-04 0003GMT ]  \par \par \uc2 The dollar plunged to a two-week low of Y109.25 overnight on a Nikkei Financial Daily column saying "some central banks officials" in \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  are expecting "large-scale" yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to ease after the end of this month. The report comes in the wake of heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Japanese monetary authorities in recent weeks as the March 31 fiscal-year end approaches.  \par \par \uc2 But suspected \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , acting through the Bank of Japan, then pulled the greenback above Y110.00, traders said. Market participants generally think Japanese monetary authorities want the dollar above Y110.00 on March 31.  \par \par \uc2 As of 0042GMT, the dollar was trading at Y110.17.  \par \par \uc2 Tanigaki said Tuesday the MOF "will continue to take appropriate action in the event there are excessive moves," underscoring the lack of change to the government's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Miyako Takebe, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; miyako.takebe@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Alastair Gale and Bennett Richardson [ 16-03-04 0050GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040315e03f000zr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
