\par\par \b \uc2 Japan's  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  foray on Tuesday seen near 500 bln yen.   \b0\par\par\uc2 509 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 11:45\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, March 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  probably \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to the tune of 500 billion yen on Tuesday to prevent the dollar from falling back under 110 yen, money market analysts estimated on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Although the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not confirmed whether it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , a sharp one-yen rebound in the dollar from the day's lows around 110.20 yen on Tuesday raised suspicions that the Japanese authorities had stepped into the market for a third straight trading day.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar was around 111.20 yen on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 The Bank of Japan's money market projections for Thursday, the day Tuesday's transactions settle, showed fund transfers from the public sector to the private sector at 860 billion yen, about 300-500 billion yen more than analysts' original projections.   \par \par \uc2 The fund transfer component of the money market projections includes such flows as tax payments and salaries paid to public servants. The overall projections include banknote issuance and government debt issuance and redemptions.   \par \par \uc2 Some analysts said the estimated amount seemed rather small considering the sharp rebound in the dollar on Friday but added that it could be showing how nervous the market had become.   \par \par \uc2 "When the dollar was struggling near 105 yen, every spike up that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  created was seen as an opportunity to sell dollars. Now it is the opposite and people just buy back dollars when they suspect \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said an analyst at a trust bank.   \par \par \uc2 From a similar analysis of Tuesday's money market balances, analysts say Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which pushed the dollar to five-month highs around 112.30 yen, or about six percent above 3-= lows hit last month, totalled nearly one trillion yen.   \par \par \uc2 There were also discrepancies in the balances on Wednesday, March 10, but the flows often deviate substantially from estimates on so-called "5 and 10" days - such as the 10th, 25th and 30th of every month - because a lot of commercial payments are concentrated on those days, so analysts said they were less certain about how big the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have been on Monday.   \par \par \uc2 Late last month, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  between January 29 and February 25 totalled 3.34 trillion yen - equivalent to nearly $30 billion at Wednesday's exchange rate.   \par \par \uc2 That followed a monthly record of 7.15 trillion yen in January - bringing the total for just the first two months of this year to about half of last year's record 20 trillion yen.   \par \par \uc2 Japan has been worried that a runaway rise in the yen would derail its export-led economic recovery and exacerbate protracted price deflation that has subdued domestic investment and spending.   \par \par \uc2 While its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy has drawn criticism from its trade partners, \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has insisted that its battle to end the yen's rise has been vindicated by a statement issued last month by the Group of Seven industrial countries that said excess volatility in exchange rates was undesirable. ($1=111.40 Yen).    \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040310e03a001nq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
