\par\par \b \uc2 Asia  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Dlr Retreats But Data, MOF Support Vs Yen -2-  \b0\par\par\uc2 388 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 07:10\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  data suggested Tokyo may not have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  as heavily as many thought to drive the yen to a five-month high Friday.  \par \par \uc2 Commercial banks' account balances at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rose by Y1.2 trillion Tuesday, pointing to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of $10 billion or less. Traders had estimated the BOJ spent as much as $20 billion.  \par \par \uc2 Still, some traders and analysts said comments by U.S. Treasury Secretary John Snow Monday may signal that U.S. patience is growing thin with \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Snow repeated the U.S. preference for a strong dollar but added that "no \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can be considered strong if it is propped up on life support with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."  \par \par \uc2 The remark followed Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan's unusually blunt warning last week that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's "awesome" accumulation of dollar reserves via \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  "will have to slow at some point and eventually cease."  \par \par \uc2 "It's a wonder that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been able to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  as heavily as it has without provoking U.S. criticism," said Satoshi Tate, a vice president for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  at UFJ Bank. "The U.S. isn't that generous."  \par \par \uc2 Tate predicted the dollar would stick to a broad range between Y110 and Y112 in the next few weeks.  \par \par \uc2 But others said the bulk of risks for the dollar/yen lie to the downside.  \par \par \uc2 A measure of trade flows by J.P. Morgan suggests short positions against the yen stand at their highest levels since last June, said Tohru Sasaki, a strategist for the bank in Tokyo. That augurs for a position-driven reversal, he said.  \par \par \uc2 The yen is trading close to its weakest levels in the past ten years in trade-weighted terms, Sasaki added.  \par \par \uc2 "Fundamentals and positioning are clearly positive for the yen," he said.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Jonathan Soble, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; jonathan.soble@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Bennett Richardson  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The chart of late Tokyo \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates that accompanied Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been replaced with an enhanced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fixture that is updated hourly.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Subscribers can find this table:  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -On Telerate pages 4046 and 1087.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -On Dow Jones Newswires by searching the code N/IFX  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -On Reuters by entering FRX or INT  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -On Bloomberg by entering NI FRX [ 09-03-04 0610GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040309e0390005u\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
